{title: Thats Enough}
{key: F}
{x_theme: prayer}
{x_source: chrd:thats_enough.chrd}

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]Well, now I heard that you been talking about me,
[C7]Really, I don't [F]mind
[F]I know you try to block my progress,
[G7]A lot of the [C7]time.
[F]Well the mean things you said, don't make me feel bad
Cause I [Bb]can't miss a friend, that I never had,
([F]I've got)  I've got [C7]Jesus, and that's enough,
([Bb]That's enough) [F]that's enough.

{comment: Verse 2}
[Bb]When I'm sick, (he's there), in trouble, (he's there)
[Bb]When I call him he will answer my prayer ([F]Answer my prayer)
When I'm burdened, (he's there), with a load, (he's there),
[G7]That's when Jesus is a comforter [C7]to my soul
[F]Well, you may scorn me, turn your back on me,
[Bb]God's got his arms wrapped all around me
([F]I've got) I've got [C7]Jesus, and that's enough,[F]
([Bb]That's enough) [F]that's enough.

{comment: Verse 3}
[Ab]You know there's been a lot of times when I didn't have a dime,
[Db]I didn't cry to nobody but my [Ab]Lord.
[Ab]He heard my plea, and came to see about me,
[G7]Cause He's one thing I [Eb7]can afford
[Ab]So if you push me down, He'll pick me up
[Db]And He'll stick by me when the going gets [Ab]tough,
(I've got) I've got [Eb7]Jesus, and that's enough,
([Db]That's enough) [Ab]that's enough.

{comment: Verse 4}
[Ab]Well He's the great emancipator and my heart regulator,
([Db]Jesus is),  [Ab]yes he is
[Ab]He'll make my way brighter and my burden lighter,
([Bb7]Yes He will), [Eb7]Jesus will
[Ab]Well, you may scorn me, turn your back on me,
[Db]God's got his arms wrapped all around me
[Ab]And He fights down the devil [Eb7]till he makes him give up, [Ab]and that's enough,
([Db]That's enough) [Ab]that's enough.
